Output media/rise.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontFamily "Iosevka Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 17
Set Width 1180
Set Height 205
Set Padding 26
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 40ms

Hide
Type "export PS1='$ ' && clear"
Enter
Sleep 300ms
Show
Type "python3 scripts/demo.py --cols 104 --seconds 9"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 9.5s
